id = "hemorrhage"
name = "Hemorrhage"
description = "Every weapon hit opens a wound: the target bleeds for 4 damage/sec over 5s. A fresh hit refreshes the full 5s and adds one stack (up to 3, +4 dmg/sec each) instead of replacing what's already bleeding -- three stacks means 12 dmg/sec. Stacks fall off together when the timer runs out; they do not tick down one at a time."
